<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #333;">

<p>Dear Validator,</p>

<p>A new proposal has been submitted and is ready for your review and validation.</p>

<table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 60%;">
  <tr style="background-color: #f2f2f2;">
    <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>Application ID</strong></td>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{!IndividualApplication__c.Name}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>Submitted By</strong></td>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{!IndividualApplication__c.Account.Name}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr style="background-color: #f2f2f2;">
    <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>Submitted On</strong></td>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{!IndividualApplication__c.Applied_Date__c}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;"><strong>Status</strong></td>
    <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd;">{!IndividualApplication__c.Application_Status__c}</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<br/>
<p>Please review the proposal by logging into the Validator Portal:</p>
<p>
  <a href="https://wadhwanifoundation--wfdev.sandbox.my.site.com/reviewersite/s/validatorportal"
     style="color: #0070d2;">
    Click here to open Validator Portal
  </a>
</p>

<p>If you have any questions, please contact the WCF team.</p>

<p>Warm regards,<br/>
<strong>Wadhwani Foundation – WCF Grant Management Team</strong><br/>
wcf@wadhwanifoundation.org</p>

</body>
</html>